WingMan drone project — Commands in order


T1 — Start the maze simulation
Option A: Use your existing launch script
Open Terminal 1:
~/ws_wingman/scripts/start_simulation.sh


Your script sets the ROS environment, Gazebo resource paths, maze world, and spawn pose before launching PX4.
Option B: Launch PX4 directly
Use this instead of Option A, not at the same time:
cd ~/PX4-Autopilot

PX4_GZ_WORLD=maze_exploration \
PX4_GZ_MODEL_POSE="0,-17.2,0.3,0,0,1.5708" \
make px4_sitl gz_x500_gps_denied


T2 -- Micro xrce
MicroXRCEAgent udp4 -p 8888


T3 -- RGB image + camera info:
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash

ros2 run ros_gz_bridge parameter_bridge \
'/world/maze_exploration/model/x500_gps_denied_0/link/camera_link/sensor/IMX214/image@sensor_msgs/msg/Image[gz.msgs.Image' \
'/world/maze_exploration/model/x500_gps_denied_0/link/camera_link/sensor/IMX214/camera_info@sensor_msgs/msg/CameraInfo[gz.msgs.CameraInfo'


T4 -- Depth point cloud
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash

ros2 run ros_gz_bridge parameter_bridge \
'/depth_camera/points@sensor_msgs/msg/PointCloud2[gz.msgs.PointCloudPacked'


T5 -- Compressed camera stream
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash

ros2 run image_transport republish raw compressed \
--ros-args \
-r in:=/world/maze_exploration/model/x500_gps_denied_0/link/camera_link/sensor/IMX214/image \
-r out/compressed:=/wingman/camera/compressed


T6 — RViz2
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/ws_ros2/install/setup.bash

QT_QPA_PLATFORM=xcb rviz2


T7 — rosbridge WebSocket

source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
ros2 launch rosbridge_server rosbridge_websocket_launch.xml \
unregister_timeout:=100.0 \
max_message_size:=10000000


T8 — Web video server
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash

ros2 run web_video_server web_video_server



